         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nIn the previous classes, we learned that when there is no one to share with, everything stays concentrated. After that, we learned that dividing by 1 also means keeping everything together.\n\nBut that is not the whole story. If we are here today, it is because the division — or sharing — allowed different things to come into existence. In this class, we will see how.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "807279f7-17f8-45f8-b9e1-5fef440fe37c",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "807279f7-17f8-45f8-b9e1-5fef440fe37c",
