         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned the concept of a fraction. We learned that we can write on top the part of something we are counting and below the total. And when we add every part together, we return to having 1.\n\nWe evaluated this in two different scenarios — with our hands and with a piece of paper — but this is only an introduction. Fractions also show us the relationship between multiplication and division, which we will explore more in the next class.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
